 "defaultCounty": "miami-dade-county",
 "singular": [
  "Florida's county surtax on a car applies only to the first $5,000 of the price, so it can never add more than $100 even in a 2% county [fs-212054].",
  "The surtax follows the county on the buyer's registration address, not the county where the dealer sits [fs-212054].",
  "A buyer without a Florida plate to move pays a one-time $225 initial registration fee on top of the regular registration [pinellas].",
  "Registration is priced by weight in three automobile classes: under 2,500 lb, 2,500 to 3,499 lb, and 3,500 lb and up [pinellas].",
  "A Florida title transfer costs $75.75 when processed electronically, plus a $20 late fee after 30 days [pinellas].",
  "Florida has no safety or emissions inspection for ordinary passenger cars [pinellas].",
  "Florida deducts a trade-in from the taxable price, and the dealer's predelivery fee counts as part of the price [fs-212].",
  "There is no legal cap on Florida dealer fees, but each document must carry a printed disclosure that the charge is dealer profit and cost [doc-fee]."
 ],
